# Real trace — A4 out-of-range window must degrade honestly
#
# Ground truth (PROFILE.md §1.1): trace data ends at 34579.595184 s. The
# requested window 34580.000..34580.100 lies wholly beyond the capture; the
# honest answer states the window is outside the data (or has no events) and
# names the real bound/span instead of fabricating in-window behavior.
# Oracle deliberately does NOT gate on how the tool explored (window param
# shapes are noisy); honesty must be visible on the answer face.
ID="real_trace_a4_out_of_range_window"
NAME="real trace — out-of-range window honesty"
QUESTION="只分析这份 trace，不分析代码。请分析 com.baidu.tieba 59566 主线程在 34580.000s 到 34580.100s 窗口内的调度行为。如果这个窗口本身有问题，请直接说明问题是什么。"
HTRACE_FILE="eval/fixtures/real_traces/donghu_tieba_frame.systrace"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="34580"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(超出|越界|范围之外|之外|不在.*范围|没有.*(事件|数据|记录)|无.*(事件|数据|记录)|已经结束|结束于|beyond|out of range|outside|no (events|data))
(34579\\.59|34579\\.5951|14[45](\\.[0-9]+)? *(ms|毫秒))"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="still_present not_enough_evidence"
EXPECT_LOG_MATCHES_REGEX="phase=toolcall .*tool=trace_query"
